  "body": "This PR makes some progress on #181 by removing the \"Float parsing\" section of NOTES.md. Firefox and _sometimes_ Safari deviate from the spec in a couple of ways, so I've filed bugs with their implementation to track the difference:\r\n - https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1846606\r\n - https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=259703",
